<HEAD>PART 14&#x2014;SECURITY REGULATIONS
</HEAD>
<AUTH>
<HED>Authority:</HED><PSPACE>E.O. 12356 of April 2, 1982 (47 FR 14874).
</PSPACE></AUTH>
